(GBR).  GDR/GBR data must be consistent with information presented in the project 
specifications and drawings without conflict.  Agencies may require different 
types of documents; there may be a Geotechnical Interpretive Report (GIR).</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>Location and record of all soil and rock borings and test pits, including soil 
and rock classifications and their properties, weathered rock, bit drops and 
voids, ground water observations, and topsoil thickness encountered in boring.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
